{"version":1,"key":"card:297","content":{"id":297,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"},{"type":"content-link","contentId":284,"contentType":"card","contentTitle":"","refId":296,"children":[{"text":"Promise.all","type":"formatted","code":true}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 可以等待多个异步任务执行完成，其返回一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Promise","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，只有这些异步任务全部执行成功时，返回的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Promise","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 才是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"resolved","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的，否则一旦一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"rejected","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，其结果就是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"rejected","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的，但是有的时候只要求同时执行，但是不要求每个都必须成功，这个时候就可以使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Promise.allSettled","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"."}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Promise.allSettled"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 接收的参数同样是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Promise","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 数组，同样返回一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Promise","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，当所有的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Promise settle","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时（成功或者失败），"},{"type":"formatted","text":"Promise","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 变为 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"resolved","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，其结果是一个数组，数组中的每个值就是每个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Promise","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的执行结果，是一个对象，有一个 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"status","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性表示执行结果是成功还是失败，有两种取值"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"fullfilled","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，执行成功，其结果可以从对象的 "},{"type":"formatte